"clic pe :guilabel:`Configurare Digest Emails`. Apoi, selectați e-mailul de "
"rezumat dorit din lista care ar trebui să fie dezactivat."

#: ../../content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:82
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Deactivate` to deactivate the digest email for "
"everyone. A deactivated digest can be reactivated with "
"the :guilabel:`Activate` button. Both buttons are located at the top of the "
