#~ msgstr "Certificat HTTPS (IoT)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "*Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure* (HTTPS) is the secure and encrypted "
#~ "version of *Hypertext Transfer Protocol* (HTTP), which is the primary "
#~ "protocol used for data communication between a web browser and a website. "
#~ "It secures communications by using an encryption protocol known as "
#~ "*Transport Layer Security* (TLS), previously called *Secure Sockets "
#~ "Layer* (SSL). The security of :abbr:`HTTPS (Hypertext Transfer Protocol "
#~ "Secure)` relies on :abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer Security)` /:abbr:`SSL "
#~ "(Secure Sockets Layer)` certificates, which authenticate the provider and "
#~ "verify their identity."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "*Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure* (HTTPS) este versiunea securizată și "
#~ "criptată a *Hypertext Transfer Protocol* (HTTP), care este protocolul "
#~ "principal folosit pentru comunicarea datelor între un browser web și un "
#~ "site. Asigură comunicațiile folosind un protocol de criptare numit "
#~ "*Transport Layer Security* (TLS), numit anterior *Secure Sockets Layer* "
#~ "(SSL). Securitatea :abbr:`HTTPS (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)` se "
#~ "bazează pe certificatele :abbr:`TLS (Transport Layer "
#~ "Security)` /:abbr:`SSL (Secure Sockets Layer)`, care autentifică "
#~ "furnizorul și verifică identitatea acestuia."

#~ msgid ""
